{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06914","headline":"仙谷遇毛女意知是秦宫人 · 常建","name":"仙谷遇毛女意知是秦宫人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪口水石浅，泠泠明药丛。\n入溪双峰峻，松栝疎幽风。\n垂岭枝嫋嫋，翳泉花蒙蒙。\n夤缘霁人目，路尽心弥通。\n盘石横阳崖，前流殊未穷。\n回潭清云影，弥漫长天空。\n水边一神女，千岁爲玉童。\n羽毛经汉代，珠翠逃秦宫。\n目觌神已寓，鹤飞言未终。\n祈君青云秘，愿谒黄仙翁。\n尝以耕玉田，龙鸣西顶中。\n金梯与天接，几日来相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}